    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/9f4b5b674aaa9c595bd8ee4822235547.webp?t=1749553709\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/e39ac8347b063766889348838be9934d.avif?t=1749553709\" data-has-big width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Zombie Epoch: Deck Apocalypse</strong></i> is a post-apocalyptic survival game that blends dungeon exploration with card-based strategy. As a survivor, you must venture into perilous ruins, scavenge scarce resources, build a powerful deck, and enhance your abilities to withstand relentless zombie hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is a battle for survival\u2014you must carefully choose your path, manage resources wisely, and craft your own playstyle from randomly obtained items and cards while facing increasingly formidable enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow stronger, you'll unlock more challenging areas, rare items, and powerful cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is not just survival, but the restoration of humanity\u2014rekindling the flames of civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Current character professions include: Machine Gunner, Researcher, Mechanic, Veteran, Ninja.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe330bf219732b88205660d8501469e5.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe330bf219732b88205660d8501469e5.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe330bf219732b88205660d8501469e5.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/3f6b6885408c6ec8a52b5af01a583234.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/3f6b6885408c6ec8a52b5af01a583234.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/3f6b6885408c6ec8a52b5af01a583234.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/c85af002b783154bf7abcffaa2c79045.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/c85af002b783154bf7abcffaa2c79045.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/c85af002b783154bf7abcffaa2c79045.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe23a9a3b291df62853375c523354fca.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe23a9a3b291df62853375c523354fca.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe23a9a3b291df62853375c523354fca.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is randomly generated, with different items, cards, and zombies appearing in every run. You'll need to plan your movement carefully, explore dungeons, and collect vital supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/9f4b5b674aaa9c595bd8ee4822235547.webp?t=1749553709\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fee5c864ab7e50a3d7af2e3432d8b1e0.avif?t=1749553709\" data-has-big width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/0a6c2b09d1ec2e9534ef64f8ef3c4b69.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/0a6c2b09d1ec2e9534ef64f8ef3c4b69.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/0a6c2b09d1ec2e9534ef64f8ef3c4b69.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of rewards and build a unique playstyle to counter the ever-growing zombie threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/406962fd507b97131bd8caa9b2655383.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/406962fd507b97131bd8caa9b2655383.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/406962fd507b97131bd8caa9b2655383.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/933eedd4d1ffd5a24cd5c33a4391f209.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/933eedd4d1ffd5a24cd5c33a4391f209.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/933eedd4d1ffd5a24cd5c33a4391f209.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot is divided into <strong>cards</strong> and <strong>items</strong>\u2014cards can be played directly in battle, while items provide passive effects. Most cards and items can stack, creating powerful synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/4ad6afa8a979b2775cd3ac71cadd87c4.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/4ad6afa8a979b2775cd3ac71cadd87c4.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/4ad6afa8a979b2775cd3ac71cadd87c4.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each dungeon run, you can unlock or upgrade buildings at your camp, permanently enhancing your character\u2019s abilities and preparing for greater challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/cf9d22a3d0f9a519267eda8be163c3f8.avif?t=1749553709\" data-has-big width=800 height=381 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of characters, each with unique traits. As you progress, you'll unlock new characters, each offering a distinct gameplay experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/9f4b5b674aaa9c595bd8ee4822235547.webp?t=1749553709\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Strategic Cardplay</strong><br>Construct your own deck and item combinations to adapt to different combat scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Dungeon Exploration</strong><br>Designed for high replayability\u2014each run is a fresh experience, full of surprises and tough choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild Humanity</strong><br>Gather resources, rebuild your base, and unlock new technologies to reclaim the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m an indie game developer, and this game is entirely created by me. If you like it, follow me and join my Discord! </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/9f4b5b674aaa9c595bd8ee4822235547.webp?t=1749553709\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/e39ac8347b063766889348838be9934d.avif?t=1749553709\" data-has-big width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Zombie Epoch: Deck Apocalypse</strong></i> is a post-apocalyptic survival game that blends dungeon exploration with card-based strategy. As a survivor, you must venture into perilous ruins, scavenge scarce resources, build a powerful deck, and enhance your abilities to withstand relentless zombie hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is a battle for survival\u2014you must carefully choose your path, manage resources wisely, and craft your own playstyle from randomly obtained items and cards while facing increasingly formidable enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow stronger, you'll unlock more challenging areas, rare items, and powerful cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is not just survival, but the restoration of humanity\u2014rekindling the flames of civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Current character professions include: Machine Gunner, Researcher, Mechanic, Veteran, Ninja.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe330bf219732b88205660d8501469e5.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe330bf219732b88205660d8501469e5.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe330bf219732b88205660d8501469e5.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/3f6b6885408c6ec8a52b5af01a583234.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/3f6b6885408c6ec8a52b5af01a583234.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/3f6b6885408c6ec8a52b5af01a583234.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/c85af002b783154bf7abcffaa2c79045.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/c85af002b783154bf7abcffaa2c79045.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/c85af002b783154bf7abcffaa2c79045.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe23a9a3b291df62853375c523354fca.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe23a9a3b291df62853375c523354fca.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fe23a9a3b291df62853375c523354fca.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is randomly generated, with different items, cards, and zombies appearing in every run. You'll need to plan your movement carefully, explore dungeons, and collect vital supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/9f4b5b674aaa9c595bd8ee4822235547.webp?t=1749553709\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/fee5c864ab7e50a3d7af2e3432d8b1e0.avif?t=1749553709\" data-has-big width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/0a6c2b09d1ec2e9534ef64f8ef3c4b69.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/0a6c2b09d1ec2e9534ef64f8ef3c4b69.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/0a6c2b09d1ec2e9534ef64f8ef3c4b69.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of rewards and build a unique playstyle to counter the ever-growing zombie threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/406962fd507b97131bd8caa9b2655383.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/406962fd507b97131bd8caa9b2655383.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/406962fd507b97131bd8caa9b2655383.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/933eedd4d1ffd5a24cd5c33a4391f209.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/933eedd4d1ffd5a24cd5c33a4391f209.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/933eedd4d1ffd5a24cd5c33a4391f209.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot is divided into <strong>cards</strong> and <strong>items</strong>\u2014cards can be played directly in battle, while items provide passive effects. Most cards and items can stack, creating powerful synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/4ad6afa8a979b2775cd3ac71cadd87c4.poster.avif?t=1749553709\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/4ad6afa8a979b2775cd3ac71cadd87c4.webm?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/4ad6afa8a979b2775cd3ac71cadd87c4.mp4?t=1749553709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each dungeon run, you can unlock or upgrade buildings at your camp, permanently enhancing your character\u2019s abilities and preparing for greater challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/cf9d22a3d0f9a519267eda8be163c3f8.avif?t=1749553709\" data-has-big width=800 height=381 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of characters, each with unique traits. As you progress, you'll unlock new characters, each offering a distinct gameplay experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/9f4b5b674aaa9c595bd8ee4822235547.webp?t=1749553709\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Strategic Cardplay</strong><br>Construct your own deck and item combinations to adapt to different combat scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Dungeon Exploration</strong><br>Designed for high replayability\u2014each run is a fresh experience, full of surprises and tough choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild Humanity</strong><br>Gather resources, rebuild your base, and unlock new technologies to reclaim the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m an indie game developer, and this game is entirely created by me. If you like it, follow me and join my Discord! </p></li></ul>",
